The endpoint that creates a new owner is **POST /api/owners**, defined by an OfficeFloor YAML pipeline. The request/response DTOs (`OwnerDto`, `OwnerFieldsDto`, `OwnerPageDto`) are **generated at build time** from `src/main/resources/openapi.yml` (there are no checked-in `.java` DTO source files under `src/main/java`). The 201 Created response is produced by `RespondWithOwnerCreated`.

